<Slide>
  <Box style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#0B1120', padding: '20px 64px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    {/* A 标题块 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 96, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', borderBottom: '2px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.3)' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#06B6D4', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2 }}>第 3 章 · 主循环</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#E2E8F0', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 4 }}>app_led_run / app_key_run</Text>
    </Box>
    {/* B 内容区：左右两函数说明 */}
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, marginTop: 16, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(59,130,246,0.10)', borderRadius: 8, padding: '16px 20px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#3B82F6', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>app_led_run()</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>
            维护 LED 闪烁节奏，反映系统「活着」。对控制逻辑无影响，仅作状态指示。初始化里闪 3 下后进入稳定节奏。
          </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(59,130,246,0.06)', borderRadius: 8, padding: '16px 20px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
            实际扫描在 <span style={{ color: '#06B6D4' }}>SysTick_Handler</span> 里每 10ms 调 <span style={{ color: '#06B6D4' }}>key_scan()</span>；app_key_run 负责处理扫描到的按键值。
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(6,182,212,0.10)', borderRadius: 8, padding: '16px 20px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#06B6D4', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>app_key_run()</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>
            处理板载物理按键，常用于本地调试（如一键回中、急停）。与 PS2 手柄是两套独立输入源，互不干扰。
          </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(251,191,36,0.08)', borderRadius: 8, padding: '16px 20px', borderLeft: '4px solid #FBBF24' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
            这两个任务执行极快、无阻塞；真正的「重活」（舵机驱动、Flash 读写）都发生在另外三个 ★ 任务与中断里。
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    {/* C 页脚 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 40, display: 'flex', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>六轴机械臂代码详解</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>21 / 41</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
